14
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,050
that deep...

15
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,030
Ah, sorry...

16
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:50,840
Let's take a break.

17
00:01:04,690 --> 00:01:06,270
Minato.

18
